Note on data
============

The catalog shards in `data/catalog/` and the reference documents in
`references/` describe datasets published on DATA.GOV.HK by Hong Kong
Government bureaux and departments. That data remains subject to the
DATA.GOV.HK terms of use (https://data.gov.hk/en/terms-and-conditions) and is
included here for discovery/attribution purposes.

The MIT licence in `LICENSE` covers this skill's own code and documentation
only, not the underlying government data.
